      "source_text": "我也不是因为个人的怨恨才让你受罪的……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am not making you suffer out of any personal grudge either...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00589",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "出于作战的需要，这是不得已而为之的手段，你也该明白吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is a necessary measure for operational reasons, and you ought to understand that.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00589",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "亏得你，对方像是有些软下来了……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thanks to you, the other side seems to have softened a little...\"",
